{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:PredictedSpectra.BaryonProductFromAlt","@type":"LeanModule","name":"PredictedSpectra.BaryonProductFromAlt","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.GroupTheory.Perm.Sign","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.baryonProductFromAlt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.baryonProductFromAlt","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/baryon-product-from-alt.lean#L60-L82","doc":"**The baryon integrand is the Alt-isotype (Vandermonde discriminant).**\n\nThe `S_3`-sign-isotype projection of the rank-3 colour-velocity tensor is the\nsigned permutation sum `Σ_{σ ∈ S_3} sgn(σ) ∏_i a_{σ(i)}^{\\,i}`, which is the\ncofactor (Laplace) expansion of the `3×3` Vandermonde determinant in the\ncolour-sheet velocities `(a, b, c)`:\n\n  `(b·c² − c·b²) − a·(c² − b²) + a²·(c − b)`\n\n(the three signed `2×2` minors along the first column).  It factors as the\ndiscriminant product `(b − a)(c − a)(c − b)` — an `R`-rational quantity\ncomputable without reference to the archimedean embedding `R ↪ ℂ`.\n\nThe non-vanishing of the discriminant for distinct `(a, b, c)` selects the\nsign isotype `Alt^3` (rather than `Sym^3`) as the baryon channel — the\nstatement made categorically in `baryon-product-from-alt.md`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:baryon-product-from-alt","label":"prop:baryon-product-from-alt","md":"quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/baryon-product-from-alt.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.signCharacter_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.signCharacter_one","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/baryon-product-from-alt.lean#L54-L58","doc":"The sign character of the identity is `1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.signCharacter_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.signCharacter_mul","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/baryon-product-from-alt.lean#L47-L52","doc":"The sign character is a group homomorphism: `sgn(σ τ) = sgn(σ) sgn(τ)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.signCharacter_eq_one_or_neg_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.signCharacter_eq_one_or_neg_one","kind":"theorem","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/baryon-product-from-alt.lean#L39-L45","doc":"The sign character takes only the values `±1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.signCharacter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.signCharacter","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/baryon-product-from-alt.lean#L33-L37","doc":"The sign character `sgn : S_3 → ℤ`, viewed as the character of\nthe alternating representation `Alt^3`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}